WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.443
Fewer warm-ups. Clearer ladders.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:08.148
Warm-ups are fewer than your working sets. They are always lighter than your first set.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:13.151
Each warm-up shows on the set card. Skip them with one tap.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:18.801
A rep ladder now spells it out. Sets first, then the reps for each set.

00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:23.261
Download Barforge Weightlifting. No account. Free to start.
